            "principal() {\n    var path = Path(\"/tmp/kofplay_lesson_pt.txt\")\n    // TODO: writeText, print(readText), delete\n}\n",
            "path.writeText(\"linha1\\nlinha2\\n\"); print(path.readText()); path.delete()",
